  "dcterms:description": "The parent who holds the child's paper DVCs and the family phone, and presents them; IHE ITI VHL VHL Holder and smart-trust Holder.\n\n**Persona**: A parent carrying a newborn's records across borders on paper and one shared phone; no health training, little time, limited connectivity.\n\n**Also known as**: VHL Holder (IHE ITI VHL); Holder (SMART Trust)\n\n**Played in the journeys by**: Bounmy SENGMANY (father, holds the family phone); Khamla SENGMANY (mother) (fictional).",
